   30      E80C        XWRT   EQU    $E80C            EDOS ROM DISK WRITE ROUTINE
   31      E815        PROG   EQU    $E815            EDOS ROM LOAD A PROGRAM & GO TO EXBUG
   32      E824        EDITR  EQU    $E824            EDOS ROM LOAD A PROGRAM, START IT @ 20 HEX
   33      EA03        XUS    EQU    $EA03            EDOS ROM TRANSMIT UNIT/SECTOR(TRANSLATED) TO DISK
   34      EA22        XUSP   EQU    $EA22            EDOS ROM TRANSMIT UNIT/ PHYSICAL SECTOR TO DISK
   35      EA2B        SEEK   EQU    $EA2B            EDOS ROM SEEK SELECTED UNIT TO TRACK IN A
   36      EA38        RFLAG  EQU    $EA38            EDOS ROM RESET ERROR FLAG
   37      EA3E        LOOP   EQU    $EA3E            EDOS ROM ISSUE COMMAND TO DISK (LOOP ON BUSY)
