 1481 0B07 96 07              LDAA   ISCTR            GET THE DRIVE & SECTOR OF THE FILE
 1482 0B09 A7 01              STAA   $1,X             AND STORE IT IN THE BUFFER
 1483 0B0B 96 04              LDAA   ISIZE            LOAD THE SIZE HIGH BYTE
 1484 0B0D A7 02              STAA   $2,X             AND STORE IT IN THE BUFFER
 1485 0B0F 96 05              LDAA   ISIZE+LBYT       LOAD THE SIZE LOW BYTE
 1486 0B11 A7 03              STAA   $3,X             AND STORE IT IN THE BUFFER
 1487 0B13 4F                 CLRA                    DELIMIT THIS RECORD WITH "0"
 1488 0B14 7E 0AAA            JMP    LSFI7            COMPLETING THIS BUFFER RECORD
 1489                  *
 1490                  *
