 1493 0B1D FE 0159            LDX    APARS            LOAD POINTER TO STRING BUFFER
 1494 0B20 96 0B              LDAA   OTRK             GET THE START TRACK OF THE FILE
 1495 0B22 A7 00              STAA   $0,X             AND STORE IT IN THE BUFFER
 1496 0B24 96 0C              LDAA   OSCTR            GET THE DRIVE & SECTOR OF THE FILE
 1497 0B26 A7 01              STAA   $1,X             AND STORE IT IN THE BUFFER
 1498 0B28 96 09              LDAA   OSIZE            LOAD THE SIZE HIGH BYTE
 1499 0B2A A7 02              STAA   $2,X             AND STORE IT IN THE BUFFER
