 1513 0B4D BD 0367     EDIT   JSR    PRSFL            PARSE INPUT STRING FOR SOURCE FILE NAME
 1514 0B50 96 C0              LDAA   FLNM0            IF NO CHARACTERS, SOURCE
 1515 0B52 81 20              CMPA   #SPC             IS FROM KEYBOARD ONLY
 1516 0B54 27 3C              BEQ    EDIT2            ELSE
