 1537 0B82 B6 0156     GEPR1  LDAA   TIUNT            ELSE DEFINE THE LOAD MODULE DISK
 1538 0B85 97 03              STAA   IUNIT            IN IUNIT
 1539 0B87 7D 0157            TST    LGOFL            IF FLAG IS .NE. 0
 1540 0B8A 27 03              BEQ    GEPR2            THEN
 1541 0B8C 7E E824            JMP    EDITR            PULL IN THE LOAD MODULE
 1542 0B8F 7E E824     GEPR2  JMP    EDITR            ELSE PULL IN THE LOAD MODULE
