 1593 0BE0 DF C7              STX    FILRQ            IF FREE SPACE IS = 0
 1594 0BE2 26 E8              BNE    DOOF2            THEN
 1595 0BE4 7E 0821            JMP    NRMMS            PRINT "NO ROOM" & WAIT FOR NEW COMMAND
