 1876                  *
 1877                  *THIS ROUTINE OUTPUTS 100 DECIMAL NULLS TO THE SWITCHED PRINT DEVICE
 1878                  *
 1879 0DAC C6 64       NULOC  LDAB   #100             DEFINE A COUNT OF
 1880 0DAE D7 C9              STAB   NULC1            100 NULLS TO BE O/P
 1881 0DB0 4F          NULO1  CLRA                    PRODUCE A NULL CHARACTER
 1882 0DB1 BD 0033            JSR    PRICV            USING SWITCH VECTOR, PRINT IT
 1883 0DB4 7A 00C9            DEC    NULC1            WHILE 100 NULLS
 1884 0DB7 26 F7              BNE    NULO1            CONTINUE TO OUTPUT NULLS
 1885 0DB9 39                 RTS                     RETURN TO CALLER
