 2070                  *THIS FUNCTION IS A GENERAL FILE DUPLICATE OR MERGE FACILITY
 2071                  *
 2072      0F07        MERGE  EQU    *
 2073 0F07 BD 0C13            JSR    SVIOF            CREATE A NAMED FCB, ATTR = FF, SIZE = FREE SPACE
 2074 0F0A BD 0367     MERG1  JSR    PRSFL            PARSE THE NEXT FILE NAME & UNIT I/D
 2075 0F0D 96 C0              LDAA   FLNM0            IF THE FILE IS DEFINED
 2076 0F0F 81 20              CMPA   #SPC             (FIRST SPACE IS OVERWRITTEN)
 2077 0F11 27 0E              BEQ    MERG3            THEN
 2078 0F13 BD 0533            JSR    DFINF            LOOK FOR THIS FILE
 2079 0F16 4D                 TSTA                    IF IT DOES NOT EXIST
 2080 0F17 27 03              BEQ    MERG2            THEN
 2081 0F19 7E 06ED            JMP    NOSFL            PRINT "NO SUCH FILE" & WAIT FOR NEW COMMAND
 2082                  *
 2083 0F1C BD 0F24     MERG2  JSR    MOVFL            MOVE SOURCE FILE TO DESTINATION FILE
 2084 0F1F 20 E9              BRA    MERG1            LOOK FOR MORE SOURCE FILES
 2085                  *
 2086 0F21 7E 0699     MERG3  JMP    FLCLS            CLOSE THE OUPUT FILE & WAIT FOR THE NEXT COMMAND
