 2431                  *
 2432                  *THIS SUBROUTINE WRITES AN END-OF-DIRECTORY FCB ENTRY
 2433                  *
 2434 116D CE 00D0     WTEOD  LDX    #SECB1           POINT TO THE SECTOR BUFFER
 2435 1170 B6 0F5C            LDAA   PUSEC            GET THE CURRENT <UNIT><SECTOR>
 2436 1173 5F                 CLRB                    SELECT TRACK 0 FOR THE DIRECTORY
 2437 1174 BD 0408            JSR    RED11            READ THIS SECTOR FROM THE DISK
 2438                  *
 2439                  *AN ERROR CHECK IS MISSING HERE!!!
 2440                  *
 2441 1177 FE 0F5A            LDX    PUFCP            POINT TO THE "NEXT FCB" DEFINED AT LAST MOVE
 2442 117A 86 2A              LDAA   #'*              DEFINE ASCII CHARACTER "*"
 2443 117C A7 00              STAA   $0,X             DEFINE THE NAME
 2444 117E A7 01              STAA   $1,X             OF THE EOD
 2445 1180 A7 02              STAA   $2,X             FILE TO BE
 2446 1182 A7 03              STAA   $3,X             "*****"
 2447 1184 A7 04              STAA   $4,X             AS AN IDENTIFIER
 2448 1186 86 FF              LDAA   #$FF             DEFINE EOD ATTRIBUTE
 2449 1188 A7 05              STAA   $5,X             AS NEW FCB ATTRIBUTE
 2450 118A 96 0B              LDAA   OTRK             TAKE THE LAST TRACK WRITTEN
 2451 118C A7 06              STAA   $6,X             AS THE START TRACK FOR THIS FCB
 2452 118E 96 0C              LDAA   OSCTR            TAKE THE LAST <UNIT><SECTOR> WRITTEN
 2453 1190 84 3F              ANDA   #$3F             STRIP OFF UNIT ID BITS
 2454 1192 A7 07              STAA   $7,X             AND USE AS START SECTOR FOR THIS FCB
 2455 1194 CE 00D0            LDX    #SECB1           POINT TO THE BEGINNING OF THE SECTOR BUFFER
 2456 1197 B6 0F5C            LDAA   PUSEC            GET <UNIT><SECTOR> FOR THIS FCB
 2457 119A 5F                 CLRB                    SELECT TRACK 0 FOR THE DIRECTORY
 2458 119B BD 0480            JSR    WRTSE            WRITE THIS SECTOR TO DISK
 2459 119E 4D                 TSTA                    IF THERE WAS NO WRITE ERROR
 2460 119F 26 A4              BNE    PURF6            THEN
 2461 11A1 39                 RTS                     RETURN TO CALLER
